Reflection and magic resistance are both important enough they
are viewed as mandatory by some.  I think they are important
enough that if you can make either redundant without eliminating
the other it's worth doing so.

Reflection sources other than artifacts: SDSM. "or, [oR.  The
shield makes #twoweapon not an option which does not matter
to some classes.

MR sources other than artifacts: GDSM, [oMR.

The fact that one has 3 options and the other 2 options suggests
that the relative shuffling is to be considered.  For many purposes
the alternate amulet in much of the game is "oLS and in much
of the game reflection saves lives.  Since reflection can be shuffled
to two other places suggest that it should be all else being the
same.  As usual with Nethack the presence of several right
answers is the reason the game remains fun for yeat after year.

